  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The order of substitution in different alkanes is\n$$\n3^{\\circ}>2^{\\circ}>1^{\\circ}\n$$\nThus the bromination of 2-methyl butane mainly gives 2-Bromo-2 - methyl butane\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/AlL06VgFamgm0nV54Nl5tltnUUl0DXeKD6d5PMn5Gmc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
